# Edge-owned HSTS, value = PP_HSTS (rendered by the image entrypoint; compose always defines it).
# Included in EVERY https location (SPA, /api proxies and the 404s nginx answers itself), so the browser sees one
# policy for the whole host. On /api the API's own production header (max-age=15552000; includeSubDomains) is
# hidden and replaced, so the ramp below is not overridden by a single API response.
# Ramp (docs/ops/platform-settings.md section 4.3): max-age=300 first, then 86400, then 15552000; add
# "; includeSubDomains" only once every subdomain of the registrable domain serves HTTPS. PP_HSTS empty = no header.
proxy_hide_header Strict-Transport-Security;
add_header Strict-Transport-Security "${PP_HSTS}" always;
